.TH WERKMEISTER-START-ARGS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-start\-args \- Print the start_session arguments (title, model, prompt, background) for the enclosing workspace, as JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister start\-args\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-start <dir>\fR
Directory to search up from (default: cwd)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Prints the arguments for starting the enclosing workspace's Claude session (title, model, prompt and background) as JSON. The next\-wave skill passes them to \fBstart_session\fR; the workspaces pane's Start button builds the same ones.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
